    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work, Relax\u2026 Then Swat for Your Life!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Buzz Off!</i> runs <strong>on top of other applications</strong>, making it the perfect companion for work, study, or gaming sessions. Stay productive, stay hydrated, and when the time runs out\u2026 <strong>defend yourself from the mosquito invasion!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Real-Time Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Set timers, get reminders, and battle mosquitoes when time\u2019s up!<br>\u2705 <strong>Hilarious Weapons</strong> \u2013 Take down swarms with everything from axes to explosive chickens.<br>\u2705 <strong>Casual Yet Chaotic</strong> \u2013 A perfect blend of productivity and ridiculous action.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unique Overlay Mode</strong> \u2013 Runs alongside your other tasks/windows</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Survive the Swarm?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take breaks, stay refreshed, and <strong>don\u2019t let the mosquitoes win.</strong> It\u2019s time to <strong>swat, shoot, and shout\u2026 <i>Buzz Off!</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work, Relax\u2026 Then Swat for Your Life!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Buzz Off!</i> runs <strong>on top of other applications</strong>, making it the perfect companion for work, study, or gaming sessions. Stay productive, stay hydrated, and when the time runs out\u2026 <strong>defend yourself from the mosquito invasion!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Real-Time Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Set timers, get reminders, and battle mosquitoes when time\u2019s up!<br>\u2705 <strong>Hilarious Weapons</strong> \u2013 Take down swarms with everything from axes to explosive chickens.<br>\u2705 <strong>Casual Yet Chaotic</strong> \u2013 A perfect blend of productivity and ridiculous action.<br>\u2705 <strong>Unique Overlay Mode</strong> \u2013 Runs alongside your other tasks/windows</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Survive the Swarm?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take breaks, stay refreshed, and <strong>don\u2019t let the mosquitoes win.</strong> It\u2019s time to <strong>swat, shoot, and shout\u2026 <i>Buzz Off!</i></strong></p>",
